          "accessed": "2026-11-08"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "evaluation": {
    "metrics": {
      "value": "官方 reasoning-required 榜单报告 Accuracy (%) 与 Macro-F1 (%)；部分模型的 Macro-F1 为 NA。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://pubmedqa.github.io/",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ]
    },
    "scoring": {
      "value": "将模型预测按 PMID 对齐后，以官方 evaluation.py 计算性能。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pubmedqa/pubmedqa/master/README.md",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ]
    },
    "prompt_settings": {
      "value": "原论文为BioBERT等监督微调，按PQA-A→PQA-U→PQA-L多阶段训练及long-answer bag-of-words辅助监督；reasoning-required测试仅给问题和去结论上下文。后续LLM提示法以每条提交设定为准。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://aclanthology.org/D19-1259.pdf",
          "accessed": "2026-11-08"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/qiaojin/PubMedQA/raw/main/README.md",
          "accessed": "2026-11-08"
        },
