          "accessed": "2026-11-08"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1909.06146",
          "accessed": "2026-11-08"
        }
      ]
    },
    "official_scripts": {
      "value": "evaluation.py：预测 JSON 的键为 PMID，值为 yes/no/maybe；运行 python evaluation.py PREDICTIONS_PATH。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pubmedqa/pubmedqa/master/README.md",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ]
    },
    "comparability_warning": {
      "value": "PQA-L官方test为500题；HF把全部1,000个PQA-L样本标作train只是打包配置，不是官方训练/测试协议。reasoning-free能看结论，不能与reasoning-required直接比较；PQA-A是弱标注预训练数据而非测试集。",
